1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,027
This butterfly has wings… but it never could fly.

2
00:00:03,107 --> 00:00:06,324
A boy had helped it… so why couldn't it fly?

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,734
Aman found a cocoon in the garden.

4
00:00:08,814 --> 00:00:11,806
A butterfly was trying to come out of it.

5
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:15,592
The butterfly struggled for hours. The hole was small, and it was getting tired.

6
00:00:15,672 --> 00:00:16,953
Aman couldn't bear to watch.

7
00:00:17,253 --> 00:00:19,392
He took scissors and cut the cocoon open.

8
00:00:19,472 --> 00:00:21,448
The butterfly came out easily.

9
00:00:21,953 --> 00:00:24,743
But its body was swollen, and its wings were shrivelled.

10
00:00:24,823 --> 00:00:27,175
Aman kept waiting for it to fly.

11
00:00:27,487 --> 00:00:29,418
But that butterfly never flew at all.

12
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:31,742
Grandpa explained,

13
00:00:31,822 --> 00:00:34,888
Son, that very struggle is what gives its wings strength.

14
00:00:34,968 --> 00:00:37,457
You took away its struggle, and its flight too.

15
00:00:38,033 --> 00:00:38,446
Lesson.

16
00:00:38,726 --> 00:00:42,233
Life's difficulties don't come to make us weak, but strong.

17
00:00:42,513 --> 00:00:45,491
Don't run from struggle, it is what teaches you to fly.

18
00:00:46,087 --> 00:00:50,726
If you want to watch stories like this every day and learn something new,

19
00:00:50,806 --> 00:00:54,669
then Like and Share the video, and do Subscribe to the channel.

20
00:00:54,749 --> 00:00:56,367
See you in the next story!
